334
00:16:58,670 --> 00:17:01,430
And after doing
SFT, as well Ampere

335
00:17:01,430 --> 00:17:05,950
is still doing 9.3%
better compared to Volta.

336
00:17:05,950 --> 00:17:09,710
And this tells us that the
advantage of adding reasoning

337
00:17:09,710 --> 00:17:11,829
data to pre-training,
it doesn't get

338
00:17:11,829 --> 00:17:17,630
