370
00:19:11,890 --> 00:19:12,430
And so on.

371
00:19:12,430 --> 00:19:16,350
So there are these two cases
that we have discussed.

372
00:19:16,350 --> 00:19:20,670
One where you use more
compute during SFT,

373
00:19:20,670 --> 00:19:26,090
