862
00:46:01,980 --> 00:46:08,150
on 250 million tokens boosts
this Nemotron-12B by 35%,

863
00:46:08,150 --> 00:46:12,010
whereas the comparison is with
20 trillion token baseline.

864
00:46:12,010 --> 00:46:14,630

865
00:46:14,630 --> 00:46:17,850
So the key takeaways
are that finally,

866
00:46:17,850 --> 00:46:21,350
what is the comparison
between Pascal, Volta, ampere,

867
00:46:21,350 --> 00:46:22,010
