00:52:54,690 --> 00:52:57,330
but it has become a
much smaller part.

994
00:52:57,330 --> 00:52:57,890
Makes sense.

995
00:52:57,890 --> 00:52:58,410
Thank you.

996
00:52:58,410 --> 00:53:00,983

997
00:53:00,983 --> 00:53:02,400
Yeah, I think that
has a lot to do

998
00:53:02,400 --> 00:53:06,480
