which like folks at Anthropic

999
00:53:06,480 --> 00:53:09,160
and so forth are focusing on.

1000
00:53:09,160 --> 00:53:11,360
Yeah, I think yeah,
RLHF is definitely

1001
00:53:11,360 --> 00:53:14,040
prone to things reward
hacking, but there's

1002
00:53:14,040 --> 00:53:16,500
a lot of ongoing work
on how to reduce that.

1003
00:53:16,500 --> 00:53:19,520

1004
00:53:19,520 --> 00:53:21,080
I can't think of
